# devmgr's test boot (M3g, M3h): devmgr reads the firmware's tables from
# croi's boot data and finds ECAM through the MCFG, with QEMU's edu device
# added (td ci: -- -device edu). amd64: it grants I/O ports.
service devmgr
program devmgr
resource mmio
resource ioport
resource irq
resource system
bootdata
programs
export
